sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant Q as QueryService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant E as Embedding API
    participant L as Chat API

    C->>A: POST /v1/query
    A->>A: request-id · auth · rate limit · validate
    alt invalid request
        A-->>C: 422 / 400 / 413 / 429
    else valid
        A->>Q: query(question, filters, budget)
        Q->>DB: readiness + active profile
        alt index not ready or profile mismatch
            Q-->>A: 503 (reason, Retry-After)
            A-->>C: error envelope
        else ready
            Q->>E: embed(question) with retry/breaker/deadline
            alt embedding unavailable
                Q->>DB: lexical fallback (FTS) if enabled
                Note over Q: degraded.mode=lexical
            else vector
                Q->>DB: candidate_k cosine search with SQL pre-filters
            end
            DB-->>Q: candidates + scores
            Q->>Q: dedupe → sandwich order → token budget → citation map
            alt no evidence above floor
                Q-->>A: abstained (no_relevant_evidence)
                A-->>C: 200 abstained, no LLM call
            else evidence
                Q->>L: static prompt + structured output
                alt chat unavailable
                    Q->>Q: extractive answer from top evidence
                    Note over Q: degraded.mode=extractive
                end
                L-->>Q: JSON answer or classified error
                Q->>Q: schema check · marker range · sentence coverage
                alt invalid and repair available
                    Q->>L: one repair request
                    L-->>Q: repaired JSON
                end
                alt still invalid
                    Q-->>A: abstained (invalid_model_output / ungrounded_answer)
                else valid
                    Q-->>A: answer + citations + usage + timings
                end
                A-->>C: 200 grounded (or 200 abstained)
            end
        end
        Q->>DB: insert query_logs (four sets, timings, outcome)
    end
